      "message": "That\u0027s not correct, **all** the cells of the node are overwritten by [`fdt_nop_node()`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/148330e81f990517e3b59aeb0b3df791ead0030d:external/dtc/libfdt/fdt_wip.c;l\u003d83;drc\u003d148330e81f990517e3b59aeb0b3df791ead0030d):\n```\nint fdt_nop_node(void *fdt, int nodeoffset)\n{\n\tint endoffset;\n\n\tendoffset \u003d fdt_node_end_offset_(fdt, nodeoffset);\n\tif (endoffset \u003c 0)\n\t\treturn endoffset;\n\n\tfdt_nop_region_(fdt_offset_ptr_w(fdt, nodeoffset, 0),\n\t\t\tendoffset - nodeoffset);\n\treturn 0;\n}\n```\n(this comment also applies to the documentation of `.nop_self()`)",
